<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="469987c3">&lt;p&gt;
    A list of objects that need to be built on top of what can be achieved through configuration of the standard
    package. It inventories the customization factors for the implementation and includes all objects.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="28a22746"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="3c3a5948"></attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="8f615ce"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="f3e7d421">&lt;p&gt;
    To list custom development elements required to address identified gaps in functionality where the standard
    package is unable to meet requirements.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="impactOfNotHaving" nodeId="e40a1893"></attribute>
<attribute name="reasonsForNotNeeding" nodeId="fcdad60"></attribute>
<attribute name="briefOutline" nodeId="6ee06580">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Development description - brief description of custom element
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Gap ID - unique identifier for each gap
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Requirements Traceability Matrix (RTM) ID - unique identifier from the RTM
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Category - element type (e.g., report, form, interface, extensions, workflow, security, etc.)
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Complexity - level of effort required to develop
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Scope - in scope, out of scope
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Value add - business value achieved through custom development
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Risks - potential risks associated with implementing the feature
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="representationOptions" nodeId="346f5fa0"></attribute>
<attribute name="representation" nodeId="f59079b6"></attribute>
